msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "Mulakan imbasan muka"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Imbas model wajah"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Tidak dapat menyimpan model muka"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Imbas model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Tidak dapat merakam model kedua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama anda telah disimpan, jadi log masuk dengan wajah sudah b"
"erfungsi. Pastikan wajah anda cukup terang dan berada di tengah, kemud"
"ian cuba lagi — atau langkau dan tambah model kemudian dari Tetapan."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Tambah model wajah (diperlukan)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Log masuk dengan wajah memerlukan sekurang-kurangnya satu model wajah,"
" jadi imbasan ini tidak boleh dilangkau. Rakam dalam pencahayaan tempa"
"t anda biasa duduk. Pencahayaan mengubah cara kamera melihat wajah and"
"a, jadi pertimbangkan untuk menambah model kedua kemudian dari Tetapan"
" yang dirakam dalam cahaya berbeza (contohnya lampu pada waktu malam d"
"an bukannya cahaya siang)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Tambah model wajah kedua (disyorkan)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Model pertama anda telah disimpan. Pencahayaan mengubah cara kamera me"
"lihat wajah anda: model yang dirakam dalam cahaya siang boleh gagal pa"
"da waktu malam di bawah lampu (atau sebaliknya), dan Ubuntu Hello kemu"
"dian tamat masa dan bukannya membuka kunci. Model kedua yang dirakam d"
"alam cahaya berbeza mengekalkan pengecaman yang boleh dipercayai pada "
"bila-bila masa."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Tukar pencahayaan dahulu: hidupkan atau matikan lampu bilik atau lampu"
" meja, berpaling dari tingkap, atau pakai cermin mata yang kadangkala "
"anda pakai. Kemudian pandang terus ke kamera dan tekan Imbas."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Persediaan Ubuntu Hello"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Menye"
"mak perkakasan dan alatan TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Perka"
"kasan TPM dikesan. Memasang <i>tpm2-tools</i> secara automatik..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Perka"
"kasan TPM 2.0 aktif. Kata laluan anda akan dimeterai dengan selamat di"
" dalam TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Perka"
"kasan TPM dikesan, tetapi pemasangan automatik <i>tpm2-tools</i> gagal"
". Jalankan <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Kembali kepada ca"
"ching kelayakan berasaskan perisian."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci {} anda secara automatik menggunakan "
"pengesahan muka (dompet yang dikesan: {}).\n\n<b>Status TPM:</b> Tiada"
" perkakasan TPM dikesan. Menggunakan caching kelayakan berasaskan peri"
"sian (AES-256-GCM)."

