#: src/onboarding.glade:62
msgid "Setup is done!"
msgstr "Persediaan selesai!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:81
msgid ""
"We're done! Ubuntu Hello is now active on this computer. Try doing any"
"thing you would normally have to type your password for to authenticat"
"e, like running a command with sudo. If you enabled keyring auto-unloc"
"k, your login keyring or KWallet will also be unlocked automatically o"
"n login.\n\nYou can open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator later on to cha"
"nge more advanced settings or add additional models. Press Finish belo"
"w to close this window and open the Ubuntu Hello Configurator. "
msgstr ""
"Kami sudah selesai! Ubuntu Hello kini aktif pada komputer ini. Cuba la"
"kukan apa sahaja yang anda biasanya perlu menaip kata laluan anda untu"
"k mengesahkan, seperti menjalankan arahan dengan sudo. Jika anda menda"
"yakan kunci buka kunci automatik, cincin kekunci log masuk anda atau K"
"Wallet juga akan dibuka secara automatik semasa log masuk.\n\nAnda bol"
"eh membuka Ubuntu Hello Configurator kemudian untuk menukar tetapan ya"
"ng lebih lanjutan atau menambah model tambahan. Tekan Selesai di bawah"
" untuk menutup tetingkap ini dan buka Ubuntu Hello Konfigurator."

#: src/onboarding.glade:129
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your login keyring or KWallet us"
"ing face authentication, preventing password prompts after logging in."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello boleh membuka kunci cincin kekunci log masuk anda secara "
"automatik atau KWallet menggunakan pengesahan muka, menghalang gesaan "
"kata laluan selepas log masuk."

#: src/onboarding.glade:141
msgid "Enable automatic keyring/KWallet unlocking"
msgstr "Dayakan cincin kekunci automatik/KWallet buka kunci"

#: src/onboarding.glade:183
msgid "Confirm password"
msgstr "Sahkan kata laluan"

#: src/onboarding.glade:215
msgid "Setting a certainty policy"
msgstr "Menetapkan dasar kepastian"

#: src/onboarding.glade:234
msgid ""
"Because of changes in angles, distance, and other factors a face match"
" is never exactly the same as the stored face model. On this page you "
"can set how strict Ubuntu Hello should be."
msgstr ""
"Kerana perubahan sudut, jarak dan faktor lain, padanan wajah tidak per"
"nah sama persis dengan model muka yang disimpan. Pada halaman ini anda"
" boleh menetapkan betapa ketatnya Ubuntu Hello sepatutnya."

#: src/onboarding.glade:273
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "Cepat"

#: src/onboarding.glade:289
msgid ""
"Allows more fuzzy matches, \nbut speeds up the scanning process greatl"
"y."
msgstr ""
"Membenarkan lebih banyak padanan kabur, \ntetapi mempercepatkan proses"
" pengimbasan dengan sangat baik."

#: src/onboarding.glade:328
msgid "Balanced"
msgstr "Seimbang"

#: src/onboarding.glade:344
msgid ""
"Still relatively quick detection, \nbut might not log you in when furt"
"her away."
msgstr ""
"Masih pengesanan yang agak cepat, \ntetapi mungkin tidak log masuk and"
"a apabila lebih jauh."

#: src/onboarding.glade:383
msgid "Secure"
msgstr "selamat"

#: src/onboarding.glade:399
msgid ""
"The slightly safer option, \nbut will take much longer to authenticate"
" you"
msgstr ""
"Pilihan yang sedikit lebih selamat, \ntetapi akan mengambil masa yang "
"lebih lama untuk mengesahkan anda"

#: src/onboarding.glade:442
msgid "Adding a face model"
msgstr "Menambah model muka"

#: src/onboarding.glade:461
msgid ""
"To authenticate you Ubuntu Hello needs to save a model of your face to"
" recognise you. Press the Scan button below to start the facial scan."
msgstr ""
"Untuk mengesahkan anda Ubuntu Hello perlu menyimpan model wajah anda u"
"ntuk mengenali anda. Tekan butang Imbas di bawah untuk memulakan imbas"
"an muka."

#: src/onboarding.glade:538
msgid "Skip for now"
msgstr "Langkau buat masa ini"

#: src/onboarding.glade:544
msgid ""
"You can add more face models later from Settings or with: sudo ubuntu-"
"hello add"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh menambah lebih banyak model wajah kemudian dari Tetapan ata"
"u dengan: sudo ubuntu-hello add"

#: src/onboarding.glade:577 src/onboarding.glade:668
msgid "Configuring webcam"
msgstr "Mengkonfigurasi kamera web"

#: src/onboarding.glade:594
msgid "Is the infrared emitter flashing ?"
msgstr "Adakah pemancar inframerah berkelip?"

#: src/onboarding.glade:612
msgid "yes"
msgstr "ya"

#: src/onboarding.glade:629
msgid "no"
msgstr "tidak"

#: src/onboarding.glade:687
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello will search your system automatically for any available c"
"ameras, so make sure your webcam is connected. After detection a list "
"of usable webcams will be shown. Pick the one you want to use and clic"
"k Next."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello akan mencari sistem anda secara automatik untuk sebarang "
"kamera yang tersedia, jadi pastikan kamera web anda disambungkan. Sele"
"pas pengesanan senarai kamera web yang boleh digunakan akan ditunjukka"
"n. Pilih yang anda mahu gunakan dan klik Seterusnya."

#: src/onboarding.glade:709
msgid "Testing your webcams, please wait..."
msgstr "Menguji kamera web anda, sila tunggu..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:761
msgid "Downloading data files"
msgstr "Memuat turun fail data"

#: src/onboarding.glade:780
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello needs three pre trained facial recognition datasets to be"
" able to recognise you, which will be downloaded now. You can see the "
"download progress below."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello memerlukan tiga set data pengecaman muka terlatih untuk d"
"apat mengenali anda, yang akan dimuat turun sekarang. Anda boleh melih"
"at kemajuan muat turun di bawah."

#: src/onboarding.glade:801
msgid "Starting download..."
msgstr "Memulakan muat turun..."

#: src/onboarding.glade:850
msgid "Welcome to Ubuntu Hello!"
msgstr "Selamat datang ke Ubuntu Hello!"

#: src/onboarding.glade:866
msgid "Version"
msgstr "Versi"

#: src/onboarding.glade:887
msgid ""
"This wizard will walk you through the setup process and automatically "
"configure Ubuntu Hello for you. Press next to continue."
msgstr ""
"Wizard ini akan membimbing anda melalui proses persediaan dan mengkonf"
"igurasi Ubuntu Hello secara automatik untuk anda. Tekan seterusnya unt"
"uk meneruskan."

#: src/onboarding.glade:911
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Batal"

#: src/onboarding.glade:931
msgid "Next"
msgstr "Seterusnya"

#: src/onboarding.glade:956
msgid "Finish setup"
msgstr "Selesaikan persediaan"

